## Core Architecture
- `src/main.rs` — Entry point, spawns async tasks
- `src/bus/` — Central publish-subscribe message bus
- `src/cpu/` — Main execution engine (Cpu<L>)
- `src/io/` — Web server, Ollama, Gemini, terminal, UNIX socket

## Subsystems
- `src/memory/` — Working + episodic + vector memory
- `src/skills/` — Pluggable skill registry
- `src/hooks/` — Phase hooks (pre/post execution)
- `src/hy_evo/` — Evolutionary workflow engine
- `src/reasoning/` — Hypothesis → Plan → Execute loop
- `src/planning/` — Planner implementations
- `src/agents/` — Unified runtime loop (RuntimeLoop)

## Key Data Flows
- User input → Web/CLI → Bus → CPU → LLM
- LLM response → Bus → CPU Forwarder → Web clients
- Cron → `agent_run` messages → CPU autonomous maintenance

## Entry Points
- `main()` → `run_bot()`
- `Cargo.toml` [[bin]] `install` for setup

